OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect's mother told
OL,4,Apolice she tried to help but 'couldn't
OL,5,Asave the girl'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a man charged with
OL,8,Fmurdering Carrie Mullane told police
OL,9,Fthat she tried to intervene but "I
OL,10,Fcouldn't save the girl", a court has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FCarrie Mullane, 39, had been missing
OL,14,Fsince she arrived in Enniskillen,
OL,15,FCounty Fermanagh, from Limerick on 10
OL,16,FOctober 2026.
OL,18,FA body was recovered by police from
OL,19,FLough Erne on Monday and the formal
OL,20,Fidentification process is still
OL,21,Fongoing. A sunken boat was also
OL,22,Fdiscovered in the water.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
