OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect's mother told
OL,4,Apolice she tried to help but 'couldn't
OL,5,Asave the girl'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Wednesday, 69-year-old Mary Lynch,
OL,8,Fof Trasna Park in Enniskillen, appeared
OL,9,Fat Dungannon Magistrates' Court charged
OL,10,Fwith withholding information from
OL,11,Fpolice.
